#1399
Credit Room~
  Just a small tweek to an old story.
Agla, Duwick and Salle stole 3 swords from Gabadiel.
They also thought they had killed Gab, but Gab had hidden
under the bed and his poor assistant was killed instead.
  While in hiding, Gab has nothing to do but think of revenge.
So he decides to get the swords back and he and the swords will
go into hiding. Right under their noses.
  When the swords disappeared, Agla, Duwick and Salle set out to
find them. (they wander now) Plus they a in a Real bad mood (aggro)
  Small clues have been left around area to lead you to Gab.
But even after you find him, you will not have it made.
He is in a !port room with 2 locked exits and one tunnel 
exit. He holds key to locked exits.
  He can't be charmed, or summoned and he's very aware and a level 50
sanct wa that will not track or even remember who hit him. He 
won't be leaving his room. (hey, I want them to work for it)
  Well, that's about the scoop. 
